+  <script>
+    // Out-of-order batch of coffee order events collected from distributed backend services
+    // with nanosecond-precision UTC ISO 8601 timestamps.
+    // Several events occur within the exact same millisecond (and microsecond), requiring
+    // Temporal.Instant nanosecond resolution to sort accurately and compute intervals.
+    const OUT_OF_ORDER_COFFEE_EVENTS = [
